/// fmri — Functional magnetic resonance imaging analysis library
///
/// Provides a complete fMRI analysis pipeline from NIfTI loading
/// through preprocessing to functional connectivity and epistemic
/// uncertainty quantification.
///
/// ## Modules
///
/// - `nifti` — NIfTI file format parser (NIfTI-1/2)
/// - `preprocess` — Motion correction, temporal filtering, normalization
/// - `atlas` — Brain atlas parcellation (AAL, Desikan-Killiany)
/// - `pipeline` — Full analysis pipeline orchestration
/// - `pipeline_real` — Real-data pipeline with file I/O
/// - `connectivity` — Functional connectivity matrices
/// - `connectivity_epistemic` — Uncertainty-aware connectivity (Knowledge<T>)
/// - `helpers` — Utility functions
///
/// ## Quick Start
///
/// ```sio
/// use fmri::pipeline
/// use fmri::connectivity
///
/// fn main() with IO, Mut, Div, Panic {
///     // Load NIfTI → preprocess → parcellate → connectivity matrix
/// }
/// ```

// Re-export modules — use `use fmri::pipeline`, `use fmri::connectivity`, etc.
